  <item>
    <title>51-国庆杂谈：跟金圣叹学怎么吐槽</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ac7891ce742e36efcbfe1c9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ac7891ce742e36efcbfe1c9</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 12:17:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一起感受一下，金圣叹评点《水浒传》与《西厢记》时的毒舌与深刻。</span></p><p><span>本期参考书目：</span></p><p><span>《金圣叹批本西厢记》，上海古籍出版社1986年4月版</span></p><p><span>《金圣叹批评水浒传》，齐鲁书社1991年1月版</span></p><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="137">02:17</a> 读水浒不读金圣叹批本，就等于没读过</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="250">04:10</a> 金圣叹其人：一个明末清初的行为艺术家</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="278">04:38</a> 金圣叹的几个真真假假的段子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="489">08:09</a> 他的评点风格：斩钉截铁，绝不端水，要么捧上天，要么踩入地</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 西厢记“断断不是淫书，断断是妙文”、水浒传“只是把宋江深恶痛绝”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="677">11:17</a> 一个字品评水浒人物</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="805">13:25</a> 粗鲁的六种写法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="866">14:26</a> 金圣叹的拉踩套路</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="957">15:57</a> 要是王实甫来写诸葛亮，能赚足人们的眼泪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1057">17:37</a> 夸李逵偏用“妩媚”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1254">20:54</a> 吐槽宋江是伪人，拎出开枷细节</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a> 吐槽鲁智深双标，罗列破戒清单</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1590">26:30</a> 胡适批评金圣叹的草蛇灰线法是“八股选家流毒”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1863">31:03</a> 景阳冈哨棒的妙处</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1922">32:02</a> 紫石街帘子的妙处</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1992">33:12</a> “一个紧字境界全出”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2111">35:11</a> 《西厢记》的“狮子滚球法”与“烘云托月法”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2205">36:45</a> “人生无道之世，大半为馒头作料，岂必十字坡、揭阳岭始能死人哉？“</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/68aeccd6d73b7726ae9d91b6/lrb7dq0XJAFa5Ps7MpGoSo8V-yGm.m4a" length="37211231" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:20</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvYm8U__PbhZu5_TlgziPq0ZI9ov.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>51</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
